        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngokuhamba kwesikhathi inkosi yaseGibhithe yafa, abantwana bakoIsrayeli babubula ngenxa yobugqili, bakhala inyembezi, bakhala kuNkulunkulu ngobugqili.",
